## ✏️ **Practice Questions (Fill in the blanks)**

1. He \_\_\_ speak five languages. (can/must)
2. You \_\_\_ not smoke here. (should/can)
3. \_\_\_ I borrow your pen? (May/Should)
4. You \_\_\_ obey your parents. (must/can)
5. We \_\_\_ go now or we’ll be late. (should/would)

✅ **Answers:**

1. can
2. should
3. May
4. must
5. should

